The profiles show `_proj_gate_mask_fp16_kernel` is the main non-BMM hotspot for most fused cases; for `N=1024, dim=384`, the current routing switches to a packed `F.linear` path, where projection `mm` is about 2.4 ms. I’m going to benchmark the existing alternate paths across the seven cases before adding new kernels.
